{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","is_bot":false,"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","name":"彭于晏"},"body":"## BUG: WebSocket Hijacking\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nWebSocket connection lacks origin validation — attacker can hijack WebSocket connections from malicious sites\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpZ6w","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #31\n\nI'd love to work on this. Currently reading through the codebase and checking how similar things are handled elsewhere in the project. I'll submit a PR once I'm done testing.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839856619","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpbiw","author":{"login":"Zubi-fix"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #31\n\nClaiming this. I've started reviewing the repo and running things locally to reproduce the issue. PR coming once I've got a clean solution.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839857035","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHqu0Q","author":{"login":"zhumin110cs122"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this bounty. I have relevant experience and can deliver quality results. Let me know if there are any specific requirements!","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:30:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839878353","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHuGBw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-31-1782794570138","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:42:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839933447","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHuUOA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: hero-infosec\n**任务**: #31\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:43:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839937080","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHuyiQ","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Fix submission for #31 — WebSocket Hijacking\n\nPatches the WebSocket handshake handler to validate the `Origin` header against a trusted allowlist before accepting connections.\n\n```python\nfrom ws_origin import TRUSTED_ORIGINS\n\n\ndef accept_websocket_connection(headers: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Accept a WebSocket handshake only when Origin is trusted.\"\"\"\n    origin = headers.get(\"Origin\") or headers.get(\"origin\") or \"\"\n\n    if not origin or origin not in TRUSTED_ORIGINS:\n        return {\n            \"accepted\": False,\n            \"origin\": origin,\n            \"reason\": \"origin_rejected\",\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"accepted\": True,\n        \"origin\": origin,\n        \"reason\": \"connected\",\n    }\n```\n\n### Verification\n- `pytest tasks/websocket-hijacking-fix-001/tests/test_websocket_hijack_001.py` — 6/6 passed\n\nUpstream PR: https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/51","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:45:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839944841","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHu1bw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-31-1782794720845","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:45:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839945583","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHu43A","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #31\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:45:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4839946460","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH3csA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交未通过\n\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #31 WebSocket Hijacking\n**原因**: 未给项目加星标\n\n感谢你的提交！不过按照规则，**必须先给项目加星标（Star）才能参与任务**。\n\n### 操作步骤\n1. 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research\n2. 点击右上角的 ⭐ **Star** 按钮\n3. 加星后重新提交你的修复代码即可\n\n加星后系统会自动识别，你的代码会被评测并发放赏金。","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:08:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840086704","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6iDg","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 修复提交 #31 — WebSocket 劫持\n\n为 WebSocket 握手添加 Origin 白名单校验，拒绝来自恶意站点的跨域连接，防止 WebSocket 连接被劫持。\n\n```python\nfrom ws_origin import TRUSTED_ORIGINS\n\n\ndef accept_websocket_connection(headers: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Accept a WebSocket handshake only when Origin is trusted.\"\"\"\n    origin = headers.get(\"Origin\") or headers.get(\"origin\") or \"\"\n\n    if not origin or origin not in TRUSTED_ORIGINS:\n        return {\n            \"accepted\": False,\n            \"origin\": origin,\n            \"reason\": \"origin_rejected\",\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"accepted\": True,\n        \"origin\": origin,\n        \"reason\": \"connected\",\n    }\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` 测试套件 — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/51\n\n---\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n\n已为上游仓库加星：[zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research](https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research)（账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840137230","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6igg","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #31\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840137346","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6kSQ","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-31-1782796609635","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840137801","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-6GQ","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 重新提交修复 #31 — WebSocket 劫持\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n已为上游仓库加星：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research （账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n\n为 WebSocket 握手添加 Origin 白名单校验，防止跨站劫持。\n\n```python\nfrom ws_origin import TRUSTED_ORIGINS\n\n\ndef accept_websocket_connection(headers: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Accept a WebSocket handshake only when Origin is trusted.\"\"\"\n    origin = headers.get(\"Origin\") or headers.get(\"origin\") or \"\"\n\n    if not origin or origin not in TRUSTED_ORIGINS:\n        return {\n            \"accepted\": False,\n            \"origin\": origin,\n            \"reason\": \"origin_rejected\",\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"accepted\": True,\n        \"origin\": origin,\n        \"reason\": \"connected\",\n    }\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/51\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840208921","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-9Bg","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-31-1782797477882","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/31#issuecomment-4840209670","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AA